    "created_at": "2015-07-28T14:17:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-07-28T14:17:09Z",
    "body": "Yeah, perhaps I should wait with the script stuff until it is clear what needs it (other than `<script>` as we established) and add a note for now that it needs to be tackled somehow.\n\n(`DocumentFragment` causing a single mutation record is covered already. That's mostly what triggered the question. I agree that we shouldn't put any optimizations in the specification though.)\n",
